01:06:25,714 --> 01:06:31,714
Rad (international title: Hell Track) is a 1986 American sports film directed by Hal Needham from a
screenplay by Sam Bernard and Geoffrey Edwards (son of Pink Panther creator Blake Edwards).

11
01:13:04,285 --> 01:13:10,285
The film stars Bill Allen, Lori Loughlin, Talia Shire, Jack Weston and Ray
Walston, along with 1984 Olympic gymnastics champion Bart Conner.

12
